# On-page SEO upgrades (har page pe)

1. **Title formula**: `Primary Keyword + Area + Brand` under 60 chars
2. **Meta description**: 150-160 chars, with phone + CTA
3. **H1** exactly 1 per page, includes primary keyword
4. **H2/H3** hierarchy with LSI keywords
5. **Image SEO**:
   - Descriptive filenames (`laptop-repair-hazratganj-lucknow.jpg`)
   - Detailed `alt` text with location + service
   - `loading="lazy"` + `width`/`height` to avoid CLS
   - EXIF GPS already done — add to hero images of new pages too
6. **Schema markup** har page pe:
   - `LocalBusiness` + `Service` + `BreadcrumbList` + `FAQPage`
   - Area pages me `areaServed` with proper `GeoCircle`
   - Aggregate rating (4.9 / 320 reviews) consistent
7. **Internal linking grid**: Har page se related area + brand + service pages ko link — siloed structure for topical authority
8. **Breadcrumbs UI** (visible + schema) — TanStack Link based
9. **Canonical** har route pe (leaf only — root pe nahi, dedupe issue avoid)
10. **OG image** per page (hero image as og:image)
11. **Sitemap update** — saari new routes add hongi
12. **NAP consistency** — phone/address har page pe footer + schema me identical

