# SEO Round 2 — Jo abhi tak chhoot raha hai

Abhi 22 routes live hain, par kuch high-impact gaps hain jo ranking aur CTR dono kharab kar rahe hain. Ye plan sirf woh cheezein cover karega jo abhi missing/broken hain — duplicate kaam nahi.

## 1. Critical fixes (high impact)

**a) Blog articles missing → 404 risk**
`/blog` page 4 articles link karta hai (`/$slug` dynamic route ke through) — par `src/routes/$slug.tsx` exist hi nahi karta. Click karte hi 404. Ya to:
- 4 real blog article routes banao (`/blog/macbook-repair-cost-lucknow`, etc.) with 800-1200 word content, FAQ schema, Article JSON-LD, internal links
- Ya blog cards ko existing service pages pe point karo

Recommend: **5 real article routes banao** (E-E-A-T + long-tail keywords ke liye crucial).

**b) Root `head()` me default "Lovable App" title/description hai**
`__root.tsx` me abhi bhi `title: "Lovable App"`, `description: "Lovable Generated Project"`, `author: "Lovable"` hai. Ye har route pe fallback ke liye use hota hai aur Twitter/OG defaults bhi galat hain. Fix: brand defaults + remove canonical risk.

**c) `og:image` har page pe missing**
Schema me `og.jpg` reference hai par file exist nahi karti. Social shares (WhatsApp, FB) pe blank preview aata hai. Fix: ek branded OG image generate karke `public/og.jpg` (1200×630) banao.

**d) `public/robots.txt` file missing**
Abhi `robots.txt` server route se serve ho raha hai — that works, but `public/` folder me physical fallback bhi rakhna best practice hai. Plus `public/favicon.ico`, `public/apple-touch-icon.png` check karne hain.

## 2. Image SEO upgrade

Abhi sirf 2 images hain (`hero-repair.jpg`, `about-tech.jpg`) — saare 22 pages me same. Fix:
- 4-6 service/area specific hero images generate karo (descriptive filenames jaise `laptop-repair-hazratganj-lucknow.jpg`)
- EXIF GPS coordinates embed (jaisa pehle kiya tha)
- Width/height attributes har `<img>` pe (CLS prevent)
- Hero image ko `fetchpriority="high"`, baaki ko `loading="lazy"`

## 3. Technical SEO additions

- **`site.webmanifest`** — PWA basics (name, short_name, icons, theme_color) — Google mobile ranking signal
- **`humans.txt`** — small trust signal
- **Breadcrumb JSON-LD** har leaf route pe (abhi sirf visible breadcrumb hai, schema nahi)
- **Service schema** har service page pe (`@type: Service` + `provider` + `areaServed` + `offers`)
- **Review schema** individual reviews ke liye (abhi sirf aggregateRating hai)
- **Speakable schema** FAQ pages pe (voice search)
- **`hreflang="en-IN"`** har page pe (India targeting)
- **Preconnect** to fonts/external domains in `__root.tsx`

## 4. Content / E-E-A-T signals

- **Author bio component** — "By [Engineer Name], 12+ years chip-level repair experience" — Google ke E-E-A-T ke liye
- **Last updated date** har service page pe (freshness signal)
- **Pricing table** har service page pe (transparency = trust + featured snippet target)
- **Before/After case studies section** (1-2 examples per service)
- **"Trusted by 5000+ customers" counter** with real numbers

